                        </p>
                        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
                            <button onclick="switchTab('deals')" class="amazon-btn font-bold text-amazon-dark px-6 py-3 text-sm shadow-md flex items-center">
                                <i class="fa-solid fa-bolt ml-2 text-amazon-dark"></i>
                                <span>تصفح عروض اليوم</span>
                            </button>
                            <a href="https://wa.me/201000000000" target="_blank" class="bg-emerald-600 hover:bg-emerald-700 text-white font-bold px-6 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm shadow-md flex items-center transition">
                                <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp text-lg ml-2"></i>
                                <span>استفسار فوري واتساب</span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="flex justify-center">
                        <div class="relative w-full max-w-md h-72 sm:h-80 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border-4 border-white/20">
                            <img src="https://placehold.co/600x400/232f3e/febd69?text=Luxury+Rattan+Set" alt="Hero Rattan" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                            <div class="absolute bottom-3 right-3 bg-black/70 backdrop-blur px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-amazon-yellow">
                                طقم جاردن رتان ملكي - خصم 20%
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Department Cards Grid -->
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 mb-12">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black mb-6 text-amazon-dark">تسوق حسب الأقسام الرئيسية</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4">
                    <div onclick="filterByDept('rattan')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer border border-gray-200 text-center group">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-chair"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amazon-text">أثاث رتان وحدائق</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs text-amazon-link mt-1 block">اكتشف التشكيلة</span>
                    </div>
                    <div onclick="filterByDept('living')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer border border-gray-200 text-center group">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-700 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-couch"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amazon-text">الصالونات والمعيشة</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs text-amazon-link mt-1 block">اكتشف التشكيلة</span>
                    </div>
                    <div onclick="filterByDept('bedroom')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer border border-gray-200 text-center group">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bed"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amazon-text">غرف النوم والفخامة</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs text-amazon-link mt-1 block">اكتشف التشكيلة</span>
                    </div>
                    <div onclick="filterByDept('umbrellas')" class="bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition cursor-pointer border border-gray-200 text-center group">
                        <div class="w-16 h-16 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-2xl mb-3 group-hover:scale-110 transition">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-umbrella"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-amazon-text">المظلات والشماسي</h3>
                        <span class="text-xs text-amazon-link mt-1 block">اكتشف التشكيلة</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Main Product Grid with Sidebar Filters -->
            <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
                <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row gap-8">
                    <!-- Filters Sidebar -->
                    <div class="w-full lg:w-64 flex-shrink-0 bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200 h-fit space-y-6">
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-base text-amazon-dark pb-3 border-b border-gray-200 flex items-center">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-filter ml-2 text-amazon-yellow"></i>
                            تصفية النتائج
                        </h3>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">الأقسام</h4>
                            <div class="space-y-2 text-xs font-medium">
                                <button onclick="filterByDept('all')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-amazon-link">كل الأقسام</button>
                                <button onclick="filterByDept('rattan')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">أثاث رتان وحدائق</button>
                                <button onclick="filterByDept('living')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">الصالونات وغرف المعيشة</button>
                                <button onclick="filterByDept('bedroom')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">غرف النوم الفاخرة</button>
                                <button onclick="filterByDept('umbrellas')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">المظلات والشماسي</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-700 mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">ترتيب حسب السعر</h4>
                            <div class="space-y-2 text-xs">
                                <button onclick="sortProducts('low-high')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">الأقل إلى الأعلى سعراً</button>
                                <button onclick="sortProducts('high-low')" class="block w-full text-right py-1.5 px-2 rounded hover:bg-gray-100 text-gray-700">الأعلى إلى الأقل سعراً</button>
